Developer and how to use (information only, not part of the licence terms above):

Developer: NitinKumar Hiremath.

How to use:
1. Install it in Antigravity from Open VSX, or from Extensions > Install from VSIX.
2. Open a project folder, then open the LocalNest panel from the nest icon in the activity bar, or from the Command Palette > LocalNest: Open Chat. You can also type @localnest in chat.
3. Pick a provider: Ollama (local), Gemini (Set Gemini API Key), or OpenAI-compatible (Set OpenAI-compatible API Key and base URL).
4. Pick a mode — Ask, Plan, Agent, or Build — type your question or task, and press Send.
5. Review the proposal, approve files one by one or approve them all, or discard it. Commands run only after you press Run approved commands.
6. Press Undo last approved changes to restore the previous files if needed.
